استورد compiler.diagnostics.identity;
استورد compiler.diagnostics.reason;

// Long-form explanations, keyed by the typed diagnostic identity.
// Every user or environment identity has its own explanation; internal compiler
// failures (ICE) share one, because the user action is the same: report it.
